# #5840 S4: after its narrow the live donor's span excludes the moved keys.
MODULE: HandOffBoundLiveAdmitsMovedKeyAfterNarrow
TARGET: HandOffBound
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the live donor admits a write of a moved key after its narrow, under its re-armed epoch
PERTURBS: LiveAdmit
BOUNDS: WithStaleDonor = TRUE, WithPreArm = TRUE, MaxWindows = 1, WithRestart = FALSE

--- FIND
    /\ liveArmed
    /\ ~sNarrowed
    /\ ~lUsed
--- REPLACE
    /\ liveArmed
\* MUTATION: no span check against the narrow.
    /\ ~lUsed
--- END
